      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "There are seven species of sea turtles. Each species has a shell for protection. Each species has strong flippers for swimming. Learn more about sea turtles."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Turtle Diet"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "url": "https://www.timeforkids.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/K1_260508_turtle_diet.jpg?w=1024",
        "alt": ""
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "This sea turtle is chasing a jellyfish. Some sea turtles also eat plants. They eat seaweed and algae."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "A Long Journey"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "url": "https://www.timeforkids.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/K1_260508_long_journey.jpg?w=1024",
        "alt": ""
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Sea turtles live in the water. But they lay eggs on land. Baby turtles hurry to the ocean when they hatch."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Sharp Eyes"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "url": "https://www.timeforkids.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/K1_260508_sharp_eyes.jpg?w=1024",
        "alt": ""
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Sea turtles have good eyesight. They can see in dark water. And they can see colors. Their eyesight helps them hunt."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "text": "Turtles in Trouble"
      },
      {
        "type": "image",
        "url": "https://www.timeforkids.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/K1_260508_turtles_in_trouble.jpg?w=1024",
        "alt": ""
      },
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "There is trash in the ocean. That is a problem for turtles. See this bag? A turtle might think it is food."
      }
    ]
  },
